# Five keyed rows. mentor carries the sentinel, two live keys and two never-existed ones; both
# standing rules cross mentor, so one tick makes two distinct crossings of one relationship.
n 5
unique id nat 7 11 13 17 19
rel id mentor -1 7 99 11 99
col nord bool 1 1 1 1 1
col dead bool 1 0 0 0 0
col gold num 0 0 0 0 0
col morale num 100 90 80 70 60
